Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Noon tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A visitor will be coming to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must not meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, you absolutely\Ncannot go to the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a visitor for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon this visit and\Ngo back to your cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,John Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who plotted everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, John Gloria is\Nmost definitely a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.02,0:00:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All you need to understand is that\Nyou're being targeted right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you out of here immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When did they...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from that door now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.02,0:00:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.93,0:01:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum! The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Time, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.26,0:01:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I just get shot? Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's begun his assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was reacting to the air currents\Nin order to predict our location.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move until we know\Nthe mechanism of the Snipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't order me around\Nlike I'm a stupid child!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know all that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,F...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,F-E-40536.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.92,0:01:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you're\Ntalking to, you bitch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.54,0:01:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you... Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And be sure not to raise your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It will keep scouting our location.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.22,0:01:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,John Gloria is able to read the\Nflow of air with that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It could even be able to react\Nto mild changes in our breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.82,0:02:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In that stand is his satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,His sniping satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where he aims his rifle at the stand,\Nwhich then redirects the bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,John Gloria is in the men's prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.66,0:02:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can\Nattack him from this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.82,0:02:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So instead, we have to\Nsmash his satellite stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Because any damage inflicted on the stand\Nis passed through to the user as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.64,0:02:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But the problem is, when\Nwe move to strike it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the change in the air current\Nwill give him our locations,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.76,0:02:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and he'll attack us immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.20,0:02:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move away from the wall, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actively hunting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sholeen, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.08,0:03:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for survival day. Get away. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.12,0:04:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hardly afford to\Nplace my faith in muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When the skin is exposed to the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,muscles become stressed and cause\Nsubtle expansions and contractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,These minor movements are ones\Nthat the body cannot control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I support the rifle with bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The bone embraces the certainty of the\Nground and the gun unifies with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I place my trust in that stability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteorologists say wind movements are\Nunpredictable and they have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this fly simply?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,buzzing around aimlessly in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.26,0:05:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hardly, this fly is guided by the\Nsmell and flow of the air as it flies?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,for the wind is the movement of the fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:05:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as the guard said,\NJotaro Kujo has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here visiting his\Ndaughter, Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.10,0:06:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means two bearers of the Joestar\Nbloodline are in that visiting room?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,placing them within range\Nof my downtown transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar, Joestar, Joestar, Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.52,0:06:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When I've finally erased your legacy,\Nonly then will my life truly begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, I will exact my vengeance for\Nyou robbing me of my heart's support.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You said we needed to take\Nthis thing out, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.17,0:06:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The droplets are making it move erratically\Nbecause it can't detect the airflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:06:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Down ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.31,0:07:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, look closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.06,0:07:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dodging the drops\Nof water one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.02,0:07:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's reading the shifts in the\Nair current caused by the drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, get back to the\Nwall before it shoots you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the guards get here, the\Nair will all shift at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, you must listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to move the stone block\Nat the bottom of the pillar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit it with all you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.94,0:07:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget what I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to make it through this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.56,0:07:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but this hole here between\Nthe walls leads down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.48,0:07:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of passageway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:08:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps into the prison\Nsewers or through a vent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell does it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,For all we know, it could lead outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.82,0:08:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.84,0:08:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't got a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.94,0:08:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It went away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it didn't. It's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's merely attempting to determine\Nthe perfect shooting angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.34,0:08:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It went to chase him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy on the other side of this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's trying to kill the boy who\Ntold us about the secret passageway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here today to help\Nyou get out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I came to this room,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,that boy, he grabbed\Nmy arm as I walked by.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As strange as it may seem, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:09:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just an ordinary kid like\Nyou'd see in the park,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and a total stranger to me\Nfor whatever it's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, he grabbed me\Nas if he depended on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It was strangely soothing, the\Nwarmth of his hand holding my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to defeat Jean Gloria\Nbefore he shoots that poor kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Check visitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire alarm is coming from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know the situation because\Nthere's no car in that room!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.69,0:09:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And how was he able to\Njust disappear like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! It's room B!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he dig this hole? In this wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have gone in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's height is roughly\Nfour and a half feet tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's small, like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.34,0:10:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who he is, but the\Nhole that suddenly opened is a vent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell right where it leads\Nby the movement of the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.66,0:10:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.57,0:10:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I must do everything in my power to\Nprevent that little guy from guiding
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro and Jolene to the vent where my\Nbullets have no hope of reaching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not lose sight of them any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll shoot down that little brat first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene the situation has gotten too heavy\Nnow the stand can only be used for defense
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,if we try to attack it it will\Ndetect the change in airflow
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,it's way too heavy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,hey you you aren't allowed to leave\Nvisitation this is the prison side
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,what the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,that thing is here too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is hunting for that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but how does he plan to\Nshoot a bullet from the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,men's prison into a utility\Nroom that has no windows
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.01,0:11:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That hatch
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope you're as\Nlucky as you are smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If his entire body is in the\Nwater, there are no air currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially inside the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it already\Nlost sight of him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:12:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And there aren't any windows in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.52,0:12:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.72,0:12:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And from where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Distance 321 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet drops 9.5\Ncentimeters in transit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.82,0:12:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wind speed of 3.2 meters from the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.78,0:12:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This shifts the bullet\N4.2 centimeters left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Target identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Point of aim is locked\Non his heart. Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Those threads, it's Jolene Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I clearly recognize her stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.42,0:12:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just jumped out of cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think that will save you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:13:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shifting point of aim to Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Headshot lined up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.12,0:13:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now say cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.78,0:13:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.24,0:13:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad I broke that pipe earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When I busted the pipe coming in\Nhere, I remembered some basic science.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Gas is lightweight,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so when it accumulates\Naround a given area,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,it can create a completely\Nseparate airflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.06,0:13:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Which would put you at a disadvantage\Nreading the air currents guess I was right
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like John Gloria\Ncouldn't read his own luck
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And how the hell is a little kid like you\Nable to move freely around this prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. You gave this to me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.82,0:14:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like some kind of bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you hand this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me not to go\Nto the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.56,0:14:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know so much about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I want an answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In time, things will be revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold on to what I\Ngave you, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.92,0:14:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that your doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I captured Jean Gallier's sniper stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't so tough when\NI had it in my net.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, I smashed it to pieces. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear you've already grown\Naccustomed to fighting using your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in here! Behind that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I just saw him moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.79,0:15:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a rifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's up there behind that pipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He crawled up above that tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be impossible. He fired\Nfrom the men's prison which is two
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,to three hundred meters away add in\Ndozens of steel bars and the fact
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.66,0:15:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,that the man is almost blind how in\Nthe world would he have been able
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,to get here so quick no idea but\NI saw him in here with us get down
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,he's in the crawlspace above
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:16:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you very well I trust you Hoorah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, gas is accumulated by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the coast is clear now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.18,0:16:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.40,0:16:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.70,0:16:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.66,0:16:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We took care of the bad guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.94,0:16:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out and tell me what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for the kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.50,0:16:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you happen to see which\Nway the little boy went?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what you're asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this boy you're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.24,0:16:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There was this kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.76,0:16:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you not see\Nhim in his baseball gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's who I was talking to when\Nwe were in the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was this boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,John Gloria was even trying to kill\Nthis kid for getting in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.84,0:16:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:16:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously I don't know\Nwhat you're talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you came all the way down\Nto this room on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I decided to follow you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.14,0:17:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on that doesn't make\Nany sense you should have
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.34,0:17:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,heard the boy's voice at least\Nthere's no way you wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,have heard him I mean he's\Nthe one who told us about
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the secret passage in the\Nfirst place we talked about it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,remember did you hear a\Nghost talking I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.86,0:17:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,anything about secret passageways\Ndamn it old man why are
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you trying to mess with my\Nhead at a time like this you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,came here through that secret\Npassageway just like I did
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.60,0:17:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second something about you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,just seems off your wound what the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.40,0:17:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,hell happened to that bullet wound\Nyou had a wound John Gloria shot
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,you in your left shoulder I saw\Nit and yet your arm isn't bleeding
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.16,0:17:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,at all what mine too my gunshot
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,wound just disappeared and who is this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.74,0:18:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,that isn't John Gloria it's\None of the guards but I
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.50,0:18:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,thought he'd been shot in\Nthe head in the visiting room
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,no sign of a wound at all\Nwhat gunshots are you talking
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,about who the devil What the\Nhell is this John Gloria?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that's something even more\Nunfortunate than death will occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, you absolutely\Ncannot go to the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The visiting room. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It was odd right from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.36,0:18:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,When did they disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And that bullet. I'd been shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.74,0:18:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But did any of that really happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:18:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither myself nor Dad are even wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.48,0:19:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Jean Gloria even attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep things straight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.70,0:19:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.18,0:19:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be hallucinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's someone else's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.72,0:19:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream was that all a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.72,0:19:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but when did I start dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I really did beat up that\Nguard, though I guess that's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:20:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a photo of John Gloria that's the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.74,0:20:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,same one that dad showed\Nme he told me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The accident with the hitchhiker how John
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloria set it all up\Nback then that's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.04,0:20:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, I got up and\Ntried to leave this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when I realized\Nmy handcuffs were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're still sitting at this\Ntable, it happened before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.76,0:20:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't stepped foot out of the\Nvisiting room since I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.74,0:20:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind made it all up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.54,0:20:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean Gallier's stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.82,0:20:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And all that bullshit about air currents?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret passageway and what followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,From the moment we stepped into this\Nvisitation room, we fell into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've been hallucinating ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly but surely, as if we were\Nsitting in a huge snake's stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we were melting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.94,0:21:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy hiding in the trash\Ncan who gave me this bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I woke up from this nightmare\Nbecause I hurt my hand on this bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Without this sharp pain, I would\Nhave stayed asleep and died!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This power of illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.36,0:21:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be Zhang Kali's actual stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.18,0:21:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired, but I can't go to sleep again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.64,0:22:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to escape from this goddamn room!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.32,0:22:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.22,0:22:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.72,0:22:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.16,0:22:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Other than he.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.68,0:22:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.92,0:23:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.60,0:23:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.08,0:23:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.70,0:23:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.42,0:23:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.42,0:24:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
